					"content": "咦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瑾武"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550414,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，你是在哪发现他的，在层岩巨渊下面吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瑾武"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550415,
					"content": "是的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550416
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710550416,
					"content": "唉，层岩巨渊地势复杂，越是往深处氛围也会变得更为阴森。",
